Error [E0102]: nothing named `f` exists here
  --> tests/ui/lambda_self_rec.jet:2:25
    |
  2 |     val f = (x: Int) => f(x);
    |                         ^
 Why: only functions that have been defined (or built in, like `print`) can be called
 Fix: define it first (fn f() { ... }), or call one that exists
